{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":972940,\"title\":\"Auschwitz, la machine de mort nazie\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2bKeFUPlRkZFlzIUG7P2edqCd6v.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9r7ntOwIsOpyG794wKwyXUf26D.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":2021,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"FR\",\"name\":\"France\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Charles Bourland\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3237314,\"name\":\"Charles Bourland\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":543580,\"title\":\"They Shall Not Grow Old\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMGfJeTXUdIjOqjS0jJfjgYEuYC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/94PXfCDB6TrTx1YwuUjzIpVXT2i.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary about World War I with never-before-seen footage to commemorate the centennial of Armistice Day, and the end of the war.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13180,\"title\":\"Zeitgeist: Addendum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5zlBxoyWRyzPOHO7QmmAC1WG9bK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/usAD0Fwx7pInwJtHwKiJnssp4iZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Director Peter Joseph examines examples of economic subjugation and offers solutions based on alignment with nature.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":127918,\"title\":\"The Gatekeepers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y7B7Ko7ZEXKcBLkO8HiGFAxAKjA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZbfWHkSZMiRmmFwxUpVcgMWFEO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In an unprecedented and candid series of interviews, six former heads of the Shin Bet — Israel's intelligence and security agency — speak about their role in Israel's decades-long counterterrorism campaign, discussing their controversial methods and whether the ends ultimately justify the means.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840390,\"title\":\"De Gaulle, l'homme à abattre\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgattSLEsiWRzbW50fkJklVK8zK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9X6IABUBwgAZRIhOqynsl6m7O9.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268626,\"title\":\"Doctors of the Dark Side\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pr5o8szoXoFFGurL0URciQNOwZj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ooBXnsOJdIzbROIgU6c8TWPveqQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctors of the Dark Side is the first feature length documentary about the pivotal role of physicians and psychologists in detainee torture. The stories of four detainees and the doctors involved in their abuse demonstrate how US Army and CIA doctors implemented the Enhanced Interrogation Techniques and covered up signs of torture at Guantanamo and Abu Ghraib. Interviews with medical, legal and intelligence experts and evidence from declassified government memos document what has been called the greatest scandal in American medical ethics. Based on four years of research by Producer/Director Martha Davis, written by Oscar winning Mark Jonathan Harris, and filmed in HD by Emmy winning DP Lisa Rinzler, the film shows how the torture of detainees could not continue without the assistance of the doctors.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456227,\"title\":\"What the War Meant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZfuOU3eyjQ9YeOx5pEC0BZ1JWG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The drama stars Beat Takeshi as General Hideki Tojo, who served as Prime Minister of Japan during World War II and was later executed as a war criminal. The story's theme is said to be a look at how the Pacific War began, focusing mostly on the three month period between the Imperial Conference (Gozen Kaigi) on September 6, 1941, and the attack on Pearl Harbor on December 7, 1941.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":643894,\"title\":\"France 1939: One Last Summer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cPGrqgCK94ZjSkdcWUYAEQDCQo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22BsDXtyMynbJ6ybJYvHcqDzX6s.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gustave Folcher, a French farmer, wrote in his 1939 diary that the summer had been long and hot. He was not alone. Many other anonymous French men and women wrote of the beauty and warmth of those summer months and how threats of war were far from their minds.  Through home movies, diaries and letters, One Last Summer describes the final weeks of peace in France and the mix of blindness, denial and prophetic clear-sightedness of those facing the war that was about to unfold.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"uWGGGb5Sl2o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"muoKCW__h0k\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"fKg0dBFQUmM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}